	(text "GND_RIG is the rig's ground and is isolated from the USB ground (GND).\nConnect the shell of J1 and the cable shield to GND_RIG only.\n\nValues are starting points. R4, R6, R7 and C1 are fixed after\nmeasuring the rig. RV1 sets the gain between 3 and 23.\n\nJ1 pin 1 is the spare for an AF output. T1 pin 4 is the unused centre tap.\nU1B is parked as a follower until its use is decided.\n\nC2, C5 and C7 are electrolytic. C1 is film or ceramic, not polarized.\nC3 and C6 are C0G."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7 165.1 0)
		(effects
